# Enforce LF line endings everywhere. biome.json's `lineEnding: "lf"` is
# the project rule; without this file, GitHub-hosted Windows runners (and
# local Windows clones) hit `core.autocrlf=true` defaults and check out
# files as CRLF — biome then refuses to format them and CI fails on the
# Windows matrix cells.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Lockfiles + binaries: don't normalize.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
